 "description": "<p>The classic bell collar in leather with an attached chain, in four set colorways - red, white, black, and pink - adjusting through 40-50 cm. This is the reference format the rest of the bell-collar category riffs on.</p>\n<p>The big bell rings softly at movement, and the chain arrives matched to the set colorway. Four colors is the joint-widest run in the accessory line.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: leather</li>\n<li>Item type: collar with chain</li>\n<li>Style: big bell</li>\n<li>Color: set red, white, black, or pink</li>\n<li>Fit: 40-50 cm circumference</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Pick the set color at order. The default bell collar against which the bow, double, and small-bell versions define themselves.</p>\n",
